    "description": "Apple II 早期配套的十字键游戏手柄外设，经游戏端口接入主机，提供八方向十字键、功能键与肩键的开关量输入。",
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Apple II 游戏手柄是苹果 II 个人电脑早期配套的十字键式游戏输入外设，与主机板载的游戏端口配合使用。它没有独立的处理器与固件，主体是一块横置握持的机身：机身左侧是十字方向键，右侧是功能键区，顶部是肩键，各键的按压都转换为开关量输入，信号沿线缆送入 Apple II 的 game_port。作为一台纯输入外设，它不产生任何显示、声音或打印输出，也不携带 ROM、固件或任何存储介质。在箱庭电子博物馆中，它作为 Apple II 游戏生态的代表性外设，以静态展示配合十字键、按键按压演示呈现。",
      "en": "The Apple II game pad is an early cross-key game input peripheral for the Apple II personal computer, used with the computer's onboard game port. It has no processor or firmware of its own; its body is a horizontal handheld shell with a cross-shaped directional pad on the left, action buttons on the right and shoulder buttons on top. Each key press is converted into a switch-level input, and the signals are carried over a cable into the Apple II game port. As a pure input peripheral it produces no display, audio or print output and carries no ROM, firmware or storage media. In the Hako Electronic Museum it represents the game ecosystem of the Apple II and is shown as a static exhibit with directional-pad and button-press demonstrations."
    },
